OL,3,GNEWSAMajor report proposes welfare
OL,4,Achanges, apprenticeships and tax cuts
OL,5,Ato help 440,000 young people into work
OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeaking for the government, Work and
OL,8,FPensions Secretary Pat McFadden calls
OL,9,Fthe report a "radical blueprint" - it's
OL,10,Fclear he agrees with it, writes Jack
OL,11,FFenwick
OL,13,FBut the Conservatives' Helen Whately
OL,14,Fsays the report is mainly a "massive
OL,15,Fspending plan" and a "massive expansion
OL,16,Fof the role of government"
